WEBVTT

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:53.042
A NETFLIX ORIGINAL FILM

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:05.625
<i>Some fish can never be trapped</i>

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:09.125
<i>because they belong to the sky.</i>

00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:17.792
IN THE NORTHERN OCEAN, THERE IS
A FISH THAT GOES BY THE NAME OF KUN.

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:23.542
THOUSANDS OF MILES IN LENGTH,
ITS SIZE IS TOO LARGE TO MEASURE.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.542
<i>Who are we?</i>

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:37.250
<i>Where do we come from?</i>

00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:40.417
<i>And where are we going?</i>

00:01:45.042 --> 00:01:47.625
<i>No one thinks about these questions.</i>

00:01:48.542 --> 00:01:51.333
<i>Day in and day out, we go to work.</i>

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:53.833
<i>Day in and day out, we laugh.</i>

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.000
<i>We complain.</i>

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:57.083
<i>We buy things.</i>

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:58.125
<i>We eat.</i>

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.292
<i>We sleep.</i>

00:02:03.542 --> 00:02:05.750
<i>A century has gone by.</i>

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:10.000
<i>And I am already 117 years old.</i>

00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:14.667
<i>As I always tell people,</i>

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:18.000
<i>every living human</i>

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:22.458
<i>is an enormous fish from the ocean.</i>

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:24.958
<i>Our lives are a journey</i>

00:02:25.542 --> 00:02:28.667
<i>across the ocean.</i>

00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:35.250
<i>No one believes my story,</i>

00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:37.292
<i>calling me an old fool.</i>

00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:41.667
<i>But I see clearly in my dreams</i>

00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:44.792
<i>schools of giant fish</i>

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.292
<i>swimming down from the sky.</i>

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.958
<i>I can hear them calling out to me.</i>

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:55.708
<i>And their lovely sound</i>
<i>awakens my memories.</i>

00:03:05.708 --> 00:03:07.917
<i>Four and a half billion years ago,</i>

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.750
<i>nothing existed on this planet</i>
<i>but a vast ocean</i>

00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:15.417
<i>and schools of giant primordial fish.</i>

00:03:17.042 --> 00:03:19.917
<i>The fish are the souls of human beings.</i>

00:03:21.292 --> 00:03:24.208
<i>And the truth is,</i>
<i>from the moment someone is born,</i>

00:03:24.917 --> 00:03:27.083
<i>they never forget that fact.</i>

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:33.833
<i>My name is Chun.</i>

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.500
<i>I come from a world beneath the ocean.</i>

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.958
<i>The sky of our world</i>

00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:41.917
<i>meets the human world</i>
<i>at the bottom of the sea.</i>

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:47.208
<i>After prolonged drifting</i>
<i>in the human world,</i>

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:51.708
<i>the souls finally reach the sky of ours.</i>

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.875
<i>We're in charge of the human souls</i>

00:03:56.417 --> 00:03:59.875
<i>as well as the natural laws</i>
<i>of everything in their world.</i>

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:03.083
<i>We are not men,</i>

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:04.792
<i>nor are we gods.</i>

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.292
<i>We are The Others.</i>

00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:47.417
The human world's starry sky is so pretty
around now.

00:04:48.292 --> 00:04:50.208
The Rite of Passage starts soon.

00:04:50.292 --> 00:04:51.292
You two hurry up.

00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.042
OK. Thanks, Brother Song Zi.

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:54.708
Sister Lei-zu.

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:57.667
Sister Lei-zu.
We're going to the ceremony.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.083
May we get two horses?

00:04:59.542 --> 00:05:00.958
Sure, help yourselves.

00:05:03.917 --> 00:05:04.833
I pick you!

00:05:05.417 --> 00:05:07.292
Wow, what a handsome horse!

00:05:07.542 --> 00:05:08.583
Taller than me!

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.125
Chun, come look!

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:13.750
-Giddy-up!
-Giddy-up!

00:05:15.875 --> 00:05:17.500
Wait for me!

00:05:18.042 --> 00:05:18.917
Hurry up!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:19.917
Giddy-up!

00:05:20.583 --> 00:05:21.417
Giddy-up!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.125
is the human world fun?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.875
Yes! I almost didn't want to come back.

00:05:27.167 --> 00:05:28.583
You shouldn't have then!

00:05:31.042 --> 00:05:32.542
Then who'd send you off?

00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:35.792
I didn't ask you to.
You wanted to come yourself!

00:05:37.292 --> 00:05:38.167
Go!

00:05:39.583 --> 00:05:40.708
-Go!
-Go!

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:53.333
The ceremony is starting!
Come quickly!

00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:05.042
-Ting Mu, be careful in the human world.
-Don't worry, Granny.

00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:07.667
Chun.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.125
Come on up.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.083
OK. Coming!

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:20.792
Granny!

00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:22.125
You got this!

00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:35.083
Up there in the human world,
you'll be on your own.

00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:37.792
Here, have some more.

00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.292
Mom, I'm really full.

00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:41.708
Brother.

00:06:41.792 --> 00:06:43.708
When will you come back?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.083
You be good. Okay?
I'll be back in seven days.

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:50.500
The sun above shines on the earth below.

00:06:50.792 --> 00:06:53.917
The gods listen
and bestow their blessings to all.

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:57.625
You'll roam the human world for seven days

00:06:57.833 --> 00:07:00.542
to observe the natural laws we govern.

00:07:01.042 --> 00:07:04.708
You mustn't have any contact with mankind.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:07.875
This is Heaven's law
that you shall never break.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.792
Gate of Sea and Sky. Open now!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.833
When you return safely,
you'll have become an adult.

00:07:50.917 --> 00:07:53.667
-You must be careful around humans. OK?
-Got it.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.250
-Remember. Avoid them completely.
-Relax. She's smart and will be fine.

00:07:57.333 --> 00:07:59.833
Fine? Last year, Ah King's daughter
never returned!

00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:02.875
What are you waiting for?

00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:04.542
Don't be late!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.583
Remember, the whirlpool is
the only passage between the two worlds.

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:17.042
-Be there on the 7th day.
-You've said this a lot.

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:18.917
-Or else you can't get back.
-I know.

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:20.500
Soup is here!

00:08:45.542 --> 00:08:47.417
My little girl is finally growing up.

00:08:49.875 --> 00:08:50.708
Time to go.

00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:52.500
Chun!

00:08:53.375 --> 00:08:54.333
Be careful.

00:08:55.042 --> 00:08:55.875
I will.

00:08:56.125 --> 00:08:57.958
Make sure to come back in time.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.042
Don't worry about us. Bye now.

00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:02.125
Please don't worry.
I shall go now.

00:09:19.042 --> 00:09:20.875
Chun! Come back here!

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:26.917
Remember,
it's a dangerous world up there.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.125
Don't ever let humans approach you.

00:09:42.708 --> 00:09:43.542
Chun!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.708
Be careful up there!

00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:48.583
We'll be waiting for your return!

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.958
<i>Every child that turned 16</i>
<i>during the past year</i>

00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:04.708
<i>was sent to the human world</i>

00:10:04.917 --> 00:10:06.917
<i>on the day of the Rite of Passage.</i>

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:13.208
<i>They got to see with their own eyes</i>
<i>how we governed the natural laws there.</i>

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:18.083
<i>The human world we saw</i>
<i>for the very first time</i>

00:10:18.958 --> 00:10:21.875
<i>looked different from</i>
<i>what the grownups described.</i>

00:10:22.542 --> 00:10:25.000
<i>We'd never been so happy.</i>

00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:28.375
<i>The human world was so beautiful.</i>

00:10:30.792 --> 00:10:32.000
Brother, look!

00:10:32.167 --> 00:10:34.417
The red dolphins are here again.

00:10:34.542 --> 00:10:36.208
They come every year.

00:10:36.583 --> 00:10:38.125
Hey, let's say hi to them!

00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:40.875
Hello!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.792
-Good to see you again!
-Good to see you again!

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:02.333
<i>I roamed the human world by myself.</i>

00:11:03.125 --> 00:11:05.125
<i>I encountered huge sailboats.</i>

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:08.500
<i>I saw city lights that looked like stars.</i>

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:13.167
<i>I also saw people lighting vigil candles</i>

00:11:13.333 --> 00:11:14.750
<i>on countless paper boats</i>

00:11:15.292 --> 00:11:17.417
<i>to escort the souls of the deceased,</i>

00:11:17.792 --> 00:11:23.583
<i>allowing the souls to float</i>
<i>down the rivers and return to the sea.</i>

00:11:24.958 --> 00:11:26.000
<i>On the sixth day,</i>

00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:29.375
<i>I followed the floating candles downstream</i>

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.167
<i>to a waterfall,</i>
<i>and I swam back to the sea.</i>

00:11:47.583 --> 00:11:48.417
Wow!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:53.583
Watch this!

00:11:56.958 --> 00:11:59.208
Wow!

00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:02.958
-You like it?
-Yes!

00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:05.458
-I have something even better.
-OK!

00:12:10.667 --> 00:12:12.333
What are you doing, Brother?

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.958
Give me a hand.
Get the fish food all over my back.

00:12:18.083 --> 00:12:18.917
OK.

00:12:21.458 --> 00:12:22.333
Naughty girl.

00:12:23.458 --> 00:12:24.917
-Wait for me here.
-OK.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.750
Wow, so many fish!

00:13:50.792 --> 00:13:53.125
What took you so long, Brother?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.167
I was chasing a red dolphin.

00:13:55.458 --> 00:13:56.625
Look, there she is.

00:13:57.792 --> 00:14:00.000
Wow, she's been following us.

00:14:00.708 --> 00:14:02.625
She's different from the others.

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:06.042
-Very intelligent.
-I think she likes you.

00:15:36.542 --> 00:15:39.625
-What's happening?
-Something at the whirlpool maybe.

00:15:39.708 --> 00:15:40.625
A dolphin.

00:15:41.083 --> 00:15:42.792
It's the red one from before.

00:15:42.875 --> 00:15:44.500
She's caught in the net!

00:15:44.875 --> 00:15:47.125
Go get my knife. I will go rescue her.

00:15:47.208 --> 00:15:50.375
-There's a whirlpool down there.
-Don't worry. I'll be careful.

00:15:52.375 --> 00:15:53.208
Quick!

00:16:04.667 --> 00:16:06.000
Be careful, Brother!

00:16:37.625 --> 00:16:38.917
Brother!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.625
I'm here to rescue you.

00:17:08.542 --> 00:17:10.917
Brother, come back!

00:18:26.083 --> 00:18:28.417
I want my brother back!

00:18:29.958 --> 00:18:31.958
Brother, come back!

00:18:32.875 --> 00:18:34.375
Brother!

00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:55.208
Chun.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.125
Thank goodness you're back.

00:18:57.875 --> 00:18:58.708
What's wrong?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.333
Are you OK?

00:19:00.417 --> 00:19:02.625
-I'm fine.
-Hey, let's wait till we get home.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.542
Glad you're back.
I'll cook something nice. OK?

00:19:21.833 --> 00:19:22.833
Morning, Granny.

00:19:23.042 --> 00:19:24.042
Is Grandpa awake?

00:19:39.167 --> 00:19:41.667
Grandpa, where do people go when they die?

00:19:44.083 --> 00:19:46.208
The body will turn into soil.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:47.958
What about the soul?

00:19:48.583 --> 00:19:52.375
The soul will drift towards
the Ascendance Manor in the far north

00:19:52.583 --> 00:19:54.542
and turn into a tiny fish

00:19:54.667 --> 00:19:56.375
guarded by the Soul Keeper.

00:19:56.917 --> 00:19:58.125
Will we die, too?

00:19:58.417 --> 00:19:59.375
That's for sure.

00:20:01.792 --> 00:20:03.917
Life and death is just nature's way.

00:20:04.458 --> 00:20:07.333
My time is almost up.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:11.083
Grandpa, I don't want you to die.

00:20:11.417 --> 00:20:13.125
Don't be silly, sweetie.

00:20:13.208 --> 00:20:15.375
Such is the law of nature.

00:20:15.917 --> 00:20:19.458
For us,
death is the gateway to immortality.

00:20:55.708 --> 00:20:58.167
What's the matter, little girl?

00:21:00.083 --> 00:21:00.917
Who is it?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:04.708
The flute sounded like
it belongs to another world.

00:21:05.292 --> 00:21:06.417
It's not mine.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.333
It sounded beautiful.

00:21:08.875 --> 00:21:10.917
Whose flute is it?

00:21:11.583 --> 00:21:14.083
It belonged to a boy from the human world.

00:21:14.417 --> 00:21:15.250
He died.

00:21:16.167 --> 00:21:17.042
Because of me.

00:21:17.292 --> 00:21:19.167
A human boy.

00:21:20.375 --> 00:21:22.583
Since he was a human,

00:21:23.375 --> 00:21:25.792
I might be able to help you.

00:21:29.542 --> 00:21:31.167
Tonight, at midnight,

00:21:31.875 --> 00:21:33.875
come back here with it.

00:21:34.542 --> 00:21:35.667
Ring it,

00:21:36.042 --> 00:21:37.750
and someone will fetch you.

00:21:39.083 --> 00:21:39.958
If you come,

00:21:41.542 --> 00:21:43.542
I'll be here waiting.

00:24:19.875 --> 00:24:21.833
Sorry. That wasn't intentional.

00:24:24.208 --> 00:24:26.208
Where are you going at this hour?

00:26:43.042 --> 00:26:45.667
<i>Sometimes, you can just feel things.</i>

00:26:47.083 --> 00:26:50.208
<i>The moment I boarded</i>
<i>that little boat, I knew</i>

00:26:51.250 --> 00:26:53.333
<i>that my destiny was changed.</i>

00:28:14.667 --> 00:28:15.833
Did you come alone?

00:28:16.792 --> 00:28:17.625
Yes.

00:28:18.625 --> 00:28:19.458
Come with me.

00:28:36.208 --> 00:28:37.042
Take a seat.

00:28:38.167 --> 00:28:39.875
It's fine. I prefer standing.

00:28:54.708 --> 00:28:56.292
When did he die?

00:28:58.292 --> 00:29:01.250
April 18th,
two days before the Grain Rain.

00:29:02.292 --> 00:29:03.833
You'd better be sure.

00:29:04.958 --> 00:29:08.792
More people die every day
than there are fleas on a cat's neck.

00:29:09.708 --> 00:29:12.250
I'm sure about the date.
It was my birthday.

00:29:12.458 --> 00:29:16.375
Everything follows the laws of nature,
yet you're blatantly defying them.

00:29:16.833 --> 00:29:17.708
I don't care.

00:29:17.917 --> 00:29:19.042
I have to save him.

00:29:19.125 --> 00:29:20.125
You don't care?

00:29:20.250 --> 00:29:23.208
All who defy nature
will be punished severely.

00:29:23.292 --> 00:29:24.208
No exceptions!

00:29:24.292 --> 00:29:25.375
I owe him my life.

00:29:25.667 --> 00:29:26.875
I have to repay him.

00:29:27.208 --> 00:29:28.875
Well, aren't you something?

00:29:29.417 --> 00:29:31.542
My 800 years
of spiritual practice here

00:29:31.625 --> 00:29:33.792
have not made up for the wrong I did.

00:29:33.875 --> 00:29:35.708
-That's because you--
-Be quiet!

00:29:36.083 --> 00:29:38.208
Let me tell you what's truly tragic.

00:29:38.625 --> 00:29:40.875
You meet someone and make a mistake.

00:29:40.958 --> 00:29:42.583
You want to make amends,

00:29:42.875 --> 00:29:45.958
only to realize in the end
how powerless you are,

00:29:46.250 --> 00:29:49.333
and that you can never make up
for the wrong you did.

00:29:51.042 --> 00:29:54.500
We can never make up for the wrong we did.

00:29:54.583 --> 00:29:57.375
-Then why did you offer to help me
-I pity you.

00:29:57.792 --> 00:30:01.667
Do you have any idea what it takes
to bring the dead back to life?

00:30:02.333 --> 00:30:03.208
What?

00:30:03.500 --> 00:30:06.375
You'll have to trade me
your most beautiful part for it.

00:30:06.458 --> 00:30:07.292
Your...

00:30:08.583 --> 00:30:09.500
eyes.

00:30:13.958 --> 00:30:15.333
Now you're scared, huh?

00:30:16.583 --> 00:30:19.833
Can't part with your pretty little eyes?

00:30:20.667 --> 00:30:23.667
Alternatively, you can give me
half your life span.

00:30:24.250 --> 00:30:25.167
For his life,

00:30:26.708 --> 00:30:27.542
I'll do it.

00:30:31.583 --> 00:30:35.417
BING YIN YEAR

00:30:35.500 --> 00:30:37.375
Oh geez. There you pooped again.

00:30:37.458 --> 00:30:39.042
Give me a break already.

00:30:42.083 --> 00:30:43.833
Why do you have so many cats?

00:30:44.875 --> 00:30:46.833
They're the only ones around here

00:30:47.250 --> 00:30:50.042
that'll keep an old fart like me company.

00:30:54.625 --> 00:30:57.500
<i>All living humans</i>

00:30:58.125 --> 00:31:02.333
<i>are giant fish from the ocean.</i>

00:31:05.417 --> 00:31:07.083
<i>From the moment of birth,</i>

00:31:07.958 --> 00:31:11.375
<i>they set off from one side of the ocean</i>
<i>toward the other.</i>

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:14.417
<i>Each life</i>

00:31:15.083 --> 00:31:17.625
<i>is like a journey across the ocean.</i>

00:31:18.750 --> 00:31:20.833
<i>Sometimes people meet.</i>

00:31:21.792 --> 00:31:24.292
<i>Sometimes people leave.</i>

00:31:29.000 --> 00:31:30.708
<i>When people die,</i>

00:31:31.667 --> 00:31:34.000
<i>they reach the other side of the ocean.</i>

00:31:35.125 --> 00:31:37.708
<i>Then each swims off to their own world.</i>

00:31:43.250 --> 00:31:45.250
This is the Chamber of Heaven,

00:31:46.417 --> 00:31:50.917
where all human souls are kept
after death.

00:31:52.417 --> 00:31:54.375
Among the countless souls,

00:31:55.625 --> 00:31:56.792
can you find his?

00:31:58.083 --> 00:31:59.917
I remember what he looked like.

00:32:04.083 --> 00:32:06.167
<i>I remember what he looked like.</i>

00:32:07.167 --> 00:32:08.917
<i>Though I don't know his name,</i>

00:32:10.708 --> 00:32:12.708
<i>I remember the way he looked at me</i>

00:32:13.167 --> 00:32:15.375
<i>and the scar on his forehead.</i>

00:32:17.292 --> 00:32:19.250
<i>I searched for six hours.</i>

00:32:20.417 --> 00:32:22.792
<i>An entire night.</i>

00:32:43.750 --> 00:32:46.125
I'll give you his soul.

00:32:46.958 --> 00:32:50.625
Infusing your soul into his is
the only way to bring him back.

00:32:51.375 --> 00:32:54.125
Your lives will from now on
be bound together.

00:32:54.750 --> 00:32:57.250
You must always protect him

00:32:57.417 --> 00:32:59.292
through all hardships,

00:32:59.667 --> 00:33:01.667
until he is big enough

00:33:02.208 --> 00:33:04.375
to return to the human world.

00:33:04.667 --> 00:33:06.833
Only then will he come back to life.

00:33:07.417 --> 00:33:08.667
Once you start,

00:33:08.875 --> 00:33:10.167
there is no turning back.

00:33:10.917 --> 00:33:14.667
Or else, his soul will vanish,
never to be found.

00:33:15.250 --> 00:33:16.542
Do you understand?

00:33:25.667 --> 00:33:26.500
Oh, sleepy boy.

00:33:26.792 --> 00:33:28.625
What were you up to last night?

00:33:39.083 --> 00:33:40.208
Do you remember me?

00:33:40.792 --> 00:33:42.750
I was the red dolphin by the sea.

00:33:44.833 --> 00:33:46.625
Do you remember your own name?

00:33:47.792 --> 00:33:49.125
What about a new name?

00:33:50.083 --> 00:33:51.625
My mom named me Chun,

00:33:52.083 --> 00:33:55.625
hoping I'd one day take over her role
to manage the begonias.

00:33:57.250 --> 00:33:59.250
I hope you will one day...

00:34:00.250 --> 00:34:01.167
grow big!

00:34:01.750 --> 00:34:03.083
Outgrow the fishbowl!

00:34:03.792 --> 00:34:05.167
Bigger than the mirror,

00:34:05.292 --> 00:34:06.292
the table,

00:34:06.875 --> 00:34:08.083
and even the bed!

00:34:08.417 --> 00:34:10.417
Even this room won't fit you,

00:34:10.792 --> 00:34:12.792
not even the whole building!

00:34:13.208 --> 00:34:15.208
<i>What are you doing?</i>
<i>What's all that noise?</i>

00:34:18.500 --> 00:34:21.167
I'll name you after
the biggest fish there is.

00:34:28.792 --> 00:34:30.292
You can't keep fish here.

00:34:30.375 --> 00:34:32.333
None of your business, you jerk!

00:34:33.708 --> 00:34:36.167
Wait! I'll keep it a secret.

00:34:37.542 --> 00:34:38.833
Why are you so mean?

00:34:42.125 --> 00:34:42.958
Hey!

00:34:43.500 --> 00:34:44.792
I know a good name.

00:34:45.417 --> 00:34:46.250
What?

00:34:46.625 --> 00:34:47.958
Open the window first.

00:34:50.458 --> 00:34:52.917
"In the Northern Ocean,
there is a fish named Kun.

00:34:53.042 --> 00:34:55.292
No one knows how many miles he spans.

00:34:55.583 --> 00:34:58.000
His wings are like great clouds
as he soars."

00:34:58.542 --> 00:34:59.792
It's from a classic.

00:35:01.542 --> 00:35:03.292
In other words, Kun, the fish

00:35:03.458 --> 00:35:04.292
is ginormous,

00:35:04.500 --> 00:35:05.583
as big as the sky.

00:35:05.667 --> 00:35:06.542
And it flies,

00:35:06.625 --> 00:35:08.125
wings the size of clouds.

00:35:08.917 --> 00:35:09.750
Are you done?

00:35:09.875 --> 00:35:11.042
-Yep.
-Bye then.

00:35:15.000 --> 00:35:15.875
From now on,

00:35:16.667 --> 00:35:17.875
your name will be...

00:35:19.458 --> 00:35:20.292
Kun!

00:35:36.042 --> 00:35:36.917
Kun.

00:35:53.500 --> 00:35:56.375
Rainstorms are unusual
for this time of the year.

00:36:03.625 --> 00:36:05.125
The rain's getting salty.

00:36:12.250 --> 00:36:13.125
You've grown!

00:36:24.458 --> 00:36:26.458
Kun, you want to play with me?

00:36:26.917 --> 00:36:27.833
Do you remember

00:36:27.917 --> 00:36:30.833
a red dolphin playing with you
like this in the sea?

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:45.833
You do!

00:36:47.208 --> 00:36:48.500
Here, come with me.

00:37:02.125 --> 00:37:03.125
You can fly!

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:07.667
You can fly in the rain!

00:37:07.750 --> 00:37:08.833
How magical!

00:37:42.792 --> 00:37:44.208
They're calling for you.

00:37:44.292 --> 00:37:46.125
Your family is waiting for you.

00:37:48.708 --> 00:37:50.375
Grow fast, Kun.

00:37:51.250 --> 00:37:52.500
I'll get you home.

00:37:53.167 --> 00:37:54.000
I swear.

00:38:19.375 --> 00:38:20.333
Kun?

00:38:22.250 --> 00:38:23.875
Mom, were you in my room?

00:38:24.917 --> 00:38:25.958
Yeah. So what?

00:38:26.125 --> 00:38:27.458
Where did you put him?

00:38:28.042 --> 00:38:28.917
I threw it away.

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:30.708
You are out of your mind.

00:38:30.917 --> 00:38:31.792
You what?

00:38:32.500 --> 00:38:34.167
Mom, he's a person!

00:38:34.375 --> 00:38:35.250
What?

00:38:35.375 --> 00:38:37.583
-Get back here and explain!
-Hey!

00:38:37.708 --> 00:38:39.917
-Please stop following me.
-Slow down.

00:38:40.792 --> 00:38:41.708
What's wrong?

00:38:42.958 --> 00:38:44.375
My mom threw Kun away.

00:38:45.542 --> 00:38:47.833
Don't worry. I know where to find him.

00:38:54.875 --> 00:38:55.792
Watch out!

00:38:55.917 --> 00:38:57.375
This way. Come.

00:39:06.917 --> 00:39:08.750
Don't worry. We'll find him.

00:39:09.708 --> 00:39:10.583
Oh?

00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:11.875
Kun?

00:39:12.500 --> 00:39:13.333
It's Kun!

00:39:14.208 --> 00:39:15.875
Hold on to me. I'll go look.

00:39:16.000 --> 00:39:17.375
What? You go?

00:39:18.333 --> 00:39:20.083
Nah, let me do it.

00:39:21.042 --> 00:39:23.417
I don't want you to go missing like Kun.

00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:24.875
Qiu!

00:39:26.333 --> 00:39:27.375
Careful!

00:39:27.458 --> 00:39:29.750
This must be the stinkiest place ever.

00:39:31.000 --> 00:39:31.875
Qiu.

00:39:32.833 --> 00:39:33.750
Thank you.

00:39:36.625 --> 00:39:37.542
Kun!

00:39:38.125 --> 00:39:38.958
Kun!

00:39:39.750 --> 00:39:41.750
Whoa! So many rats!

00:39:44.083 --> 00:39:46.292
What should we do? They will eat Kun!

00:39:46.917 --> 00:39:48.583
You bet they will.

00:39:49.000 --> 00:39:51.708
They'll devour him in the blink of an eye.

00:39:55.250 --> 00:39:58.500
-Hmm. What's the enchanting smell?
-Ugh. Stinky as hell!

00:40:01.167 --> 00:40:05.792
Aha. It's the smell of love.

00:40:06.375 --> 00:40:09.625
How may I serve you, handsome?

00:40:10.292 --> 00:40:12.125
I'm looking for a fish.

00:40:12.542 --> 00:40:15.125
A fish? I have seen one.

00:40:15.750 --> 00:40:17.875
Really? Could you help me find him?

00:40:19.083 --> 00:40:21.625
It wasn't just any fish.

00:40:22.250 --> 00:40:24.583
You got it from the Soul Keeper, right?

00:40:25.625 --> 00:40:28.333
Good people turned fish are in his charge.

00:40:28.583 --> 00:40:31.125
Bad people turned rats are in my purview.

00:40:31.667 --> 00:40:35.667
My little rats are much cuter
than those little fish of his.

00:40:36.208 --> 00:40:38.125
Can you really help me find Kun?

00:40:38.667 --> 00:40:40.042
Mmm, no.

00:40:41.542 --> 00:40:42.625
Unless...

00:40:43.250 --> 00:40:47.042
-I dance with your handsome boy!
-Go ahead!

00:40:47.917 --> 00:40:50.125
Come here, sweet baby boy.
Music!

00:40:56.750 --> 00:40:57.583
Chun.

00:40:58.708 --> 00:41:03.125
TREASURE

00:41:03.208 --> 00:41:05.792
Boys should learn not only how to dance,

00:41:08.458 --> 00:41:10.583
but also how to control their rats.

00:41:19.583 --> 00:41:21.792
The human world is a wonderful place.

00:41:22.375 --> 00:41:23.750
You've been there, too?

00:41:24.000 --> 00:41:25.625
Look. That's him, right?

00:41:32.292 --> 00:41:33.125
Kun!

00:41:33.375 --> 00:41:34.208
You alright?

00:41:35.292 --> 00:41:36.125
Kun!

00:41:37.208 --> 00:41:38.167
Welcome back.

00:41:42.708 --> 00:41:43.542
How is he?

00:41:44.542 --> 00:41:45.750
He's not responding.

00:41:50.292 --> 00:41:51.125
He's awake!

00:41:52.625 --> 00:41:54.625
What a pure soul.

00:41:55.417 --> 00:41:59.167
For sure he'll grow into a big fish.

00:42:06.458 --> 00:42:07.333
I can see you!

00:42:12.375 --> 00:42:13.583
I will find you!

00:42:19.708 --> 00:42:21.167
Where are they?

00:42:36.417 --> 00:42:37.292
Ah!

00:42:38.000 --> 00:42:39.542
Grandpa Houtu!

00:42:39.875 --> 00:42:43.167
There's a fish!

00:42:44.625 --> 00:42:46.500
Right here. In the well.

00:42:51.333 --> 00:42:52.458
How come it's gone?

00:42:52.542 --> 00:42:54.500
I definitely saw a fish in here.

00:42:54.833 --> 00:42:58.000
The recent downpours and seawater backflow

00:42:58.667 --> 00:43:00.375
are bad omens.

00:43:00.750 --> 00:43:02.625
Everyone must be most vigilant.

00:43:03.125 --> 00:43:04.000
Yes.

00:43:07.875 --> 00:43:09.958
Glad I acted fast.
They almost caught him!

00:43:21.875 --> 00:43:23.750
Kun, this is your new home now.

00:43:24.625 --> 00:43:25.458
Come here.

00:43:29.083 --> 00:43:30.375
Chun, look!

00:43:30.792 --> 00:43:31.792
It's so much fun.

00:43:45.042 --> 00:43:45.875
Ah! Look out!

00:44:03.292 --> 00:44:04.167
Qiu.

00:44:06.167 --> 00:44:07.667
Stay...stay away!

00:44:07.750 --> 00:44:09.000
It has two heads!

00:44:11.792 --> 00:44:12.625
Qiu!

00:44:24.250 --> 00:44:25.583
Qiu! Be careful!

00:44:33.208 --> 00:44:34.083
Qiu!

00:44:42.208 --> 00:44:43.083
Chun.

00:44:44.250 --> 00:44:45.083
I'm exhausted.

00:44:46.625 --> 00:44:47.917
So drowsy.

00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:49.542
You OK? Stay awake.

00:44:50.000 --> 00:44:51.250
You must not fall asleep!

00:44:51.333 --> 00:44:52.167
I'll sing.

00:44:52.375 --> 00:44:53.625
I'll sing to you.

00:44:54.958 --> 00:44:59.208
The moon and stars hanging above the sea.

00:45:00.708 --> 00:45:04.542
<i>-The breeze and drizzle--</i>
<i>-You are terrible at this.</i>

00:45:04.833 --> 00:45:06.625
So that you won't fall asleep!

00:45:10.750 --> 00:45:13.208
Chun, where are we?

00:45:13.542 --> 00:45:14.667
We're almost there.

00:45:15.500 --> 00:45:16.875
Don't fall asleep.

00:45:24.125 --> 00:45:24.958
Grandpa!

00:45:25.125 --> 00:45:26.375
Please save Qiu!

00:45:27.333 --> 00:45:30.333
Qiu was attacked
by a poisonous double-headed snake.

00:45:31.750 --> 00:45:32.708
For its venom,

00:45:33.042 --> 00:45:34.250
there's no cure.

00:45:34.667 --> 00:45:36.375
Grandpa, please save Qiu.

00:45:38.208 --> 00:45:39.083
Chun.

00:45:40.292 --> 00:45:41.500
This is for you.

00:45:41.875 --> 00:45:43.750
There might be a last resort.

00:45:45.583 --> 00:45:47.125
Chun, step outside.

00:45:47.583 --> 00:45:48.708
I'll give it a try.

00:46:39.750 --> 00:46:41.750
Hey! You're getting me all wet!

00:46:42.417 --> 00:46:44.250
Qiu, you recovered?

00:46:45.167 --> 00:46:47.083
Yeah, your grandpa is awesome.

00:46:47.167 --> 00:46:48.292
I'm completely healed.

00:46:49.208 --> 00:46:51.792
He sure is! Grandpa is a master
in medicinal herbs.

00:47:02.000 --> 00:47:03.167
Hey, my love.

00:47:04.250 --> 00:47:07.500
Do you still remember where we first met?

00:47:17.500 --> 00:47:20.333
-Grandpa.
-Chun, come here.

00:47:21.792 --> 00:47:22.667
Grandpa.

00:47:23.083 --> 00:47:24.667
It's time for me to leave.

00:47:27.375 --> 00:47:29.167
Grandpa, this is all my fault.

00:47:30.208 --> 00:47:32.167
Don't blame yourself, dear.

00:47:33.167 --> 00:47:35.792
It's just the natural order of things.

00:47:36.875 --> 00:47:38.958
No one can escape it.

00:47:40.292 --> 00:47:41.417
I know,

00:47:41.750 --> 00:47:44.500
you are doing something very dangerous.

00:47:45.375 --> 00:47:47.708
Something everyone else disapproves of.

00:47:48.833 --> 00:47:51.333
But as long as you keep your heart kind,

00:47:52.042 --> 00:47:54.958
it doesn't matter how they may judge you.

00:47:56.000 --> 00:47:58.000
Just follow your heart.

00:47:59.250 --> 00:48:01.333
When I turn into a begonia tree

00:48:01.583 --> 00:48:05.458
and reunite with your grandma,
we'll always be there for you.

00:48:09.250 --> 00:48:11.917
Grandma was the master of all birds.

00:48:12.583 --> 00:48:16.417
<i>When she died, she turned into a phoenix</i>
<i>and kept Grandpa company.</i>

00:48:17.458 --> 00:48:20.167
<i>Two days after she died,</i>
<i>Grandpa joined her.</i>

00:48:21.375 --> 00:48:23.875
<i>All the birds came that day,</i>

00:48:24.875 --> 00:48:27.667
<i>as if Grandma had come back.</i>

00:48:34.875 --> 00:48:37.792
<i>Snow in mid-summer.</i>
<i>The seasons have gone haywire.</i>

00:48:37.875 --> 00:48:39.583
Something very bad is coming.

00:48:44.667 --> 00:48:46.208
How can it be snowing now?

00:48:47.000 --> 00:48:49.792
Snowy days are my favorite!

00:48:55.583 --> 00:48:57.000
Do you think God exists?

00:48:57.375 --> 00:48:58.208
No.

00:48:59.417 --> 00:49:00.292
I do.

00:49:00.375 --> 00:49:01.625
No one's ever seen him.

00:49:01.708 --> 00:49:03.125
Nor have humans seen us.

00:49:03.667 --> 00:49:04.500
Yet we exist.

00:49:05.833 --> 00:49:08.208
If there is a God,
he'll definitely punish me.

00:49:10.500 --> 00:49:12.875
Qiu, I'm afraid when my parents get old,

00:49:13.208 --> 00:49:14.792
I can't take care of them.

00:49:15.167 --> 00:49:16.375
What are you saying?

00:49:17.250 --> 00:49:19.333
-My life span is cut in half.
-What?

00:49:19.708 --> 00:49:20.542
Why?

00:49:21.333 --> 00:49:23.458
A deal with the Soul Keeper for Kun.

00:49:23.583 --> 00:49:25.292
<i>Chun? Where are you?</i>

00:49:26.292 --> 00:49:27.583
<i>Chun, get down here!</i>

00:49:27.667 --> 00:49:30.083
-Coming!
-My daughter wouldn't do such a thing!

00:49:30.167 --> 00:49:32.875
<i>Doesn't matter.</i>
<i>We will demand her explanation.</i>

00:49:33.208 --> 00:49:35.500
<i>The Elders are beginning to suspect her.</i>

00:49:35.583 --> 00:49:36.958
Kun is in great danger.

00:49:37.708 --> 00:49:38.583
Who are you?

00:49:38.667 --> 00:49:40.792
You don't remember me now, handsome?

00:49:41.042 --> 00:49:43.583
Go hide Kun in the frozen river
by the cave.

00:49:44.125 --> 00:49:46.750
Chun will be punished
if someone finds out.

00:49:47.708 --> 00:49:48.708
Now!

00:50:05.750 --> 00:50:07.333
You'll be big trouble for Chun.

00:50:08.042 --> 00:50:08.917
Come with me.

00:50:18.500 --> 00:50:20.583
Chun's in danger with you near her.

00:50:22.458 --> 00:50:24.458
If you don't want her to get hurt,

00:50:24.542 --> 00:50:25.375
then go.

00:50:36.458 --> 00:50:37.375
Where's Kun?

00:50:37.875 --> 00:50:38.750
I let him go.

00:50:39.125 --> 00:50:40.667
Go? To where?

00:50:40.750 --> 00:50:42.792
I set him free... into the river.

00:50:46.042 --> 00:50:46.917
Chun!

00:50:47.000 --> 00:50:48.250
It's for your safety!

00:51:49.833 --> 00:51:52.750
Oh darling. Finally you're mine.

00:51:53.792 --> 00:51:56.875
Now that I have you,
I can go to the human world.

00:52:11.875 --> 00:52:12.750
Kun.

00:52:13.250 --> 00:52:15.250
I thought I'd never see you again.

00:52:22.500 --> 00:52:24.042
We need to find a way out.

00:52:24.708 --> 00:52:25.750
Let's follow them.

00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:16.708
QUEEN MOTHER OF THE IMMORTALS

00:55:22.583 --> 00:55:23.667
I have no parents.

00:55:24.458 --> 00:55:25.750
My grandma raised me.

00:55:26.500 --> 00:55:28.708
No one cared for me. I'm a daredevil.

00:55:29.500 --> 00:55:32.292
But what I'm most afraid of in this world

00:55:32.917 --> 00:55:33.917
is you suffering.

00:55:41.458 --> 00:55:42.750
I didn't expect this.

00:55:43.750 --> 00:55:45.667
That he'd mean this much to you.

00:55:47.125 --> 00:55:48.042
I'm so scared

00:55:49.083 --> 00:55:50.417
that they'll hurt you.

00:55:53.375 --> 00:55:54.375
Wake up, OK?

00:57:10.000 --> 00:57:10.875
Kun.

00:57:22.458 --> 00:57:23.292
Kun.

00:58:12.250 --> 00:58:14.542
Kun, I'm awake because of you, right?

00:58:15.167 --> 00:58:16.417
You've grown so much.

00:58:18.042 --> 00:58:19.417
Let's never be apart.

00:59:02.042 --> 00:59:02.875
Your turn.

00:59:03.667 --> 00:59:04.667
What a bad hand!

00:59:06.458 --> 00:59:09.083
Since you're here,
you might as well come in.

00:59:14.708 --> 00:59:16.000
Sorry to bother you.

00:59:16.292 --> 00:59:17.125
Triple!

00:59:20.250 --> 00:59:21.333
I have a question.

00:59:21.792 --> 00:59:22.875
Yeah? What?

00:59:23.167 --> 00:59:25.542
Why did you give the human soul to Chun?

00:59:26.833 --> 00:59:27.958
We made a deal.

00:59:28.750 --> 00:59:30.833
If you're willing to pay the price,

00:59:30.917 --> 00:59:33.167
anything under the sun can be traded.

00:59:34.625 --> 00:59:35.792
With half of a lifetime?

00:59:37.333 --> 00:59:39.000
You figured it out.

00:59:40.875 --> 00:59:41.750
So...

00:59:41.917 --> 00:59:44.958
may I trade you half of my life span
for Chun's?

00:59:45.875 --> 00:59:46.958
Of course you can.

00:59:47.042 --> 00:59:48.917
However, the price has gone up.

00:59:49.000 --> 00:59:51.375
You'll have to give us your whole life.

00:59:51.833 --> 00:59:52.708
Fine.

00:59:54.750 --> 00:59:56.125
I should warn you...

00:59:56.333 --> 00:59:58.042
even that won't save her.

00:59:58.375 --> 01:00:02.042
That little girl's life is tied
to that big fish of hers.

01:00:02.333 --> 01:00:04.167
When it dies, so does she.

01:00:04.708 --> 01:00:06.083
What if it's sent away?

01:00:07.042 --> 01:00:08.833
If it's sent away,

01:00:09.042 --> 01:00:11.417
-the day it leaves
-is the day she dies.

01:00:13.333 --> 01:00:14.750
How can I save her then?

01:00:16.500 --> 01:00:17.500
Mahjong!

01:00:17.875 --> 01:00:19.042
Flush!

01:00:21.500 --> 01:00:24.333
Play a round with me.
I will tell you if you win.

01:00:25.333 --> 01:00:26.583
But the table's full.

01:00:26.667 --> 01:00:27.583
There.

01:00:28.208 --> 01:00:29.208
We need one more.

01:00:46.083 --> 01:00:47.875
Looks like I got lucky. I won.

01:00:49.625 --> 01:00:50.458
Let's see.

01:00:53.833 --> 01:00:55.333
There's no such thing as luck.

01:00:55.417 --> 01:00:58.000
Good or bad, luck is all just fate.

01:01:03.833 --> 01:01:05.833
The answer is in your hands.

01:01:06.583 --> 01:01:07.500
My hands?

01:01:08.583 --> 01:01:10.667
The answer is in your hands.

01:01:11.250 --> 01:01:12.792
In your hands.

01:01:28.167 --> 01:01:30.125
Sorry for bothering you. Thank you.

01:01:30.250 --> 01:01:31.500
Little brats like you

01:01:31.583 --> 01:01:34.125
treat life like a rock you find
on the road.

01:01:34.333 --> 01:01:38.500
Only we old farts are racking our brains
to figure out how to live longer.

01:01:40.333 --> 01:01:41.417
Without happiness,

01:01:41.500 --> 01:01:43.292
what's the point of longevity?

01:03:08.375 --> 01:03:10.833
There's something I want to forget,
but I can't.

01:03:10.958 --> 01:03:12.125
Then stop trying.

01:03:12.500 --> 01:03:14.750
Real forgetting should take no effort.

01:03:16.292 --> 01:03:17.125
But it hurts.

01:03:18.250 --> 01:03:20.333
Pain can sometimes be a good thing.

01:03:21.833 --> 01:03:24.458
Do you have anything
that'll make it go away?

01:03:24.542 --> 01:03:28.708
There's something that'll make you forget
all your sorrows as well as happiness.

01:03:28.792 --> 01:03:31.208
It's called... Meng Po potion.

01:03:34.625 --> 01:03:36.333
I'll just get some wine then.

01:03:42.375 --> 01:03:44.042
Do you have a hangover cure?

01:03:44.125 --> 01:03:45.542
It'll be my first drink.

01:03:59.000 --> 01:04:00.833
Do you even know who loves you?

01:04:01.042 --> 01:04:02.458
You are loved by a god!

01:04:03.042 --> 01:04:05.125
He defies all other gods to love you!

01:04:05.208 --> 01:04:08.458
He endures all hardship and pain
just to make you happy!

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:18.750
The sea is flowing backward.
Heaven is enraged!

01:04:22.042 --> 01:04:24.667
We must get rid of
the inauspicious creature!

01:04:29.125 --> 01:04:30.875
I know where the big fish is.

01:04:31.875 --> 01:04:36.667
But you'll have to first set me free
and let me see the sun again.

01:04:42.333 --> 01:04:44.333
Things are getting awfully messy.

01:04:45.417 --> 01:04:47.250
Time for a big cleanup.

01:04:48.792 --> 01:04:51.500
Are you ready, my baby?

01:04:54.458 --> 01:04:56.958
<i>When the big fish comes, we all gotta go.</i>

01:04:57.292 --> 01:04:59.792
<i>One family moves away after another.</i>

01:05:01.458 --> 01:05:03.667
<i>Everyone is moving up to the mountain.</i>

01:05:03.792 --> 01:05:07.250
<i>Where will my home be?</i>

01:05:07.917 --> 01:05:11.167
<i>The wind is strong and the rain heavy.</i>

01:05:11.375 --> 01:05:14.583
<i>The flood swallowed every home.</i>

01:05:15.250 --> 01:05:17.875
<i>Need a new house after the old one's gone.</i>

01:05:18.958 --> 01:05:21.542
<i>Where will my home be?</i>

01:05:22.417 --> 01:05:24.833
<i>Where will my home be?</i>

01:05:34.167 --> 01:05:37.750
Madam! Terrible news!
The Mask of the Dragon is gone!

01:05:38.333 --> 01:05:39.167
What?

01:05:53.125 --> 01:05:53.958
Chun!

01:05:54.042 --> 01:05:56.250
I've been looking for you like crazy!

01:05:57.542 --> 01:05:59.833
Listen to me.
Turn that monster over to us!

01:05:59.917 --> 01:06:02.417
He's not a monster.
I won't let you hurt him!

01:06:03.083 --> 01:06:03.917
You ingrate!

01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:07.667
Mom, I'm sorry.

01:06:19.083 --> 01:06:20.667
Feng, why'd you stop?

01:06:21.833 --> 01:06:22.833
Go get it!

01:06:24.250 --> 01:06:26.042
-Let me do it!
-Go away!

01:06:34.958 --> 01:06:36.625
Kun, let's run!

01:06:39.000 --> 01:06:40.208
Don't let it escape!

01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:43.292
Kun, fly!

01:06:49.333 --> 01:06:50.250
Chun!

01:06:50.542 --> 01:06:51.625
Now's your chance!

01:06:51.917 --> 01:06:54.000
I'll help you get Kun home!

01:06:54.458 --> 01:06:55.833
Heavens no!

01:06:55.917 --> 01:06:58.500
Chun, you must leave with Kun!

01:06:58.917 --> 01:07:00.000
-Go!
-Qiu.

01:07:00.083 --> 01:07:01.625
Qiu, don't be foolish!

01:07:01.708 --> 01:07:03.875
You're not strong enough to open the Gate!

01:07:16.667 --> 01:07:19.208
Oh my goodness. Go get his grandma!

01:07:19.458 --> 01:07:22.833
Kun, fly up! I can't hold on much longer!

01:07:23.458 --> 01:07:24.750
Come on!

01:07:24.875 --> 01:07:26.417
Kun, fly higher!

01:07:29.917 --> 01:07:31.917
Here I come, human world!

01:07:32.958 --> 01:07:34.958
All thanks to you, handsome!

01:07:35.417 --> 01:07:37.625
I'll think of you from up there.

01:07:41.542 --> 01:07:43.375
What a transgression to Heaven!

01:07:44.542 --> 01:07:49.042
Without a token from the human world,
one can't pass the Gate of Sea and Sky.

01:08:47.333 --> 01:08:48.458
Grandpa saved us.

01:08:59.750 --> 01:09:00.667
Kun!

01:09:01.292 --> 01:09:02.125
Kun!

01:09:09.250 --> 01:09:10.750
Kun, be strong.

01:09:14.292 --> 01:09:17.208
From the day we met
to when our fates came together,

01:09:17.292 --> 01:09:19.500
I've never regretted a single second.

01:09:30.875 --> 01:09:33.500
Song Zi, how come
Zhu Rong is not here today?

01:09:33.583 --> 01:09:34.667
We'll go find him.

01:09:40.042 --> 01:09:40.875
Granny?

01:09:42.708 --> 01:09:45.125
-Someone's in the water!
-Go save them!

01:09:45.250 --> 01:09:46.208
Help!

01:09:46.292 --> 01:09:47.708
Please help us!

01:09:52.583 --> 01:09:53.792
Save the girl first!

01:09:59.333 --> 01:10:00.750
-Little sister!
-Brother!

01:10:01.875 --> 01:10:03.667
Have you seen Qiu?

01:10:04.167 --> 01:10:06.417
Ting Mu's still there.
I'll go get him.

01:10:06.500 --> 01:10:07.500
I'll go with you.

01:10:08.875 --> 01:10:09.708
Ting Mu!

01:10:09.833 --> 01:10:10.667
Ting Mu!

01:10:10.833 --> 01:10:11.667
Ting Mu!

01:10:12.333 --> 01:10:13.250
Ting Mu!

01:10:14.500 --> 01:10:15.375
Ting Mu!

01:10:27.042 --> 01:10:29.042
Kun, we can't give up!

01:10:30.542 --> 01:10:32.875
You must fly
to the Gate of Sea and Sky!

01:10:38.333 --> 01:10:40.000
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

01:10:40.250 --> 01:10:41.458
Grandpa's protecting me.

01:10:43.500 --> 01:10:45.208
Silly, don't stay here.

01:10:45.792 --> 01:10:46.625
Fly!

01:10:54.167 --> 01:10:55.000
The monster!

01:10:57.542 --> 01:10:58.667
We must catch it!

01:10:59.208 --> 01:11:01.458
Let's find and save Ting Mu first.

01:11:01.875 --> 01:11:04.458
Don't let it escape!
It'll only bring more disaster.

01:11:20.208 --> 01:11:21.042
Kun!

01:11:32.625 --> 01:11:33.458
Kun!

01:11:34.333 --> 01:11:35.208
Kun!

01:11:42.625 --> 01:11:43.458
Grandpa.

01:11:46.708 --> 01:11:48.292
Grandpa, what should I do?

01:11:53.625 --> 01:11:54.667
What should I do?

01:12:14.042 --> 01:12:14.875
Grandpa.

01:12:17.000 --> 01:12:17.833
Grandpa.

01:12:38.875 --> 01:12:39.750
Grandma!

01:12:53.917 --> 01:12:54.750
Kun!

01:12:57.292 --> 01:12:59.792
Please let him go.
He's done nothing wrong!

01:12:59.875 --> 01:13:01.208
Why are you doing this?

01:13:01.292 --> 01:13:03.625
He died saving me. I need to repay him!

01:13:04.417 --> 01:13:06.208
His sister's waiting for him!

01:13:06.292 --> 01:13:08.583
Do you know the flood swept away Ting Mu?

01:13:08.667 --> 01:13:10.208
He also has a sister waiting.

01:13:22.125 --> 01:13:23.667
Everybody run!

01:13:25.458 --> 01:13:28.208
Build a bridge!
Run to the mountaintop!

01:13:28.708 --> 01:13:30.167
Feng, give me a hand!

01:13:42.167 --> 01:13:43.875
Oh no! They're in danger!

01:13:43.958 --> 01:13:44.792
Let's go back!

01:13:52.792 --> 01:13:54.792
I can't stay with you till the end.

01:13:54.875 --> 01:13:56.542
I need to go help my family.

01:14:08.917 --> 01:14:10.000
-Ting Mu!
-Brother!

01:14:10.083 --> 01:14:11.708
-Did you find him?
-Brother?

01:14:11.792 --> 01:14:13.042
We couldn't find him.

01:14:13.333 --> 01:14:14.875
-What?
-I'm sorry.

01:14:16.583 --> 01:14:18.125
I want my brother back!

01:14:25.875 --> 01:14:27.667
Mom.

01:14:31.583 --> 01:14:33.542
Mom! I'll come help you!

01:14:36.958 --> 01:14:38.292
We don't need you!

01:14:41.542 --> 01:14:44.083
My child, pease just go.

01:14:44.417 --> 01:14:46.167
Give me my Ting Mu back!

01:15:25.292 --> 01:15:27.500
Hurry up! Don't fall behind!

01:16:08.875 --> 01:16:10.208
Feng!

01:16:15.542 --> 01:16:16.833
This is all my fault.

01:16:17.500 --> 01:16:19.458
I don't want to make them suffer.

01:16:20.542 --> 01:16:21.375
But Kun,

01:16:21.792 --> 01:16:23.625
you must do your best and fly.

01:16:24.292 --> 01:16:25.333
You must get out.

01:16:27.542 --> 01:16:29.667
I want you to live a beautiful life,

01:16:30.083 --> 01:16:31.292
just like before.

01:16:33.000 --> 01:16:34.208
I have faith in you.

01:16:41.208 --> 01:16:42.833
Grandpa, here I come.

01:18:21.042 --> 01:18:22.000
Mom!

01:18:23.583 --> 01:18:24.583
Mom!

01:18:24.792 --> 01:18:26.125
I'm here!

01:18:26.458 --> 01:18:27.292
Brother!

01:20:06.042 --> 01:20:08.708
I have been waiting for you.

01:20:41.250 --> 01:20:42.583
Why haven't you left?

01:20:45.417 --> 01:20:47.458
Lei-zu made this for you.

01:20:47.542 --> 01:20:49.833
Try it on and see if it fits.

01:20:50.750 --> 01:20:51.583
Thanks.

01:20:55.000 --> 01:20:56.083
Why am I here?

01:20:56.792 --> 01:20:57.917
I thought I died.

01:20:58.042 --> 01:20:58.958
I saved you.

01:20:59.417 --> 01:21:01.417
But you've lost your powers

01:21:01.792 --> 01:21:03.333
and no longer belong here.

01:21:03.417 --> 01:21:04.542
And everyone else?

01:21:05.042 --> 01:21:07.042
Don't worry. You saved everyone.

01:21:08.208 --> 01:21:10.750
The flood has connected
the water and the land.

01:21:11.792 --> 01:21:14.708
All the way south
is the Southern Heaven Lake.

01:21:15.208 --> 01:21:17.000
You can send him all the way home.

01:21:18.708 --> 01:21:20.875
However,
once he returns to the human world,

01:21:21.583 --> 01:21:22.958
he'll forget all about you.

01:21:24.375 --> 01:21:25.250
That's fine.

01:21:27.083 --> 01:21:28.917
Please tell my mom I'm alive.

01:21:31.125 --> 01:21:31.958
Goodbye.

01:21:35.833 --> 01:21:36.667
Thank you.

01:21:38.167 --> 01:21:39.333
No need.

01:21:40.042 --> 01:21:41.708
It's just a business deal.

01:21:42.250 --> 01:21:45.583
Instead, thank the fellow
who traded his life for yours.

01:21:59.000 --> 01:21:59.875
Chun!

01:22:01.042 --> 01:22:01.917
Chun!

01:22:02.667 --> 01:22:04.375
Chun! Wait for me!

01:22:04.833 --> 01:22:06.458
I'm coming with you!

01:22:09.292 --> 01:22:11.250
Help! I can't swim!

01:22:33.375 --> 01:22:34.500
Penny for your thoughts?

01:22:35.958 --> 01:22:36.917
So many stars.

01:22:39.833 --> 01:22:41.625
Whenever I look up at the sky,

01:22:42.125 --> 01:22:43.625
I hear something calling.

01:22:46.250 --> 01:22:47.333
When someone dies,

01:22:47.875 --> 01:22:50.208
they'll never see the pretty sky again.

01:22:51.083 --> 01:22:54.375
Do you believe love can be eternal,
just like the stars?

01:22:55.333 --> 01:22:56.167
I do.

01:22:58.083 --> 01:23:00.958
After we send Kun off,
shall we go home together?

01:23:01.792 --> 01:23:04.083
I've lost my powers and can't go back.

01:23:05.458 --> 01:23:06.875
The human world is nice.

01:23:07.500 --> 01:23:09.042
Do you want to live there?

01:23:09.625 --> 01:23:10.458
With Kun?

01:23:11.292 --> 01:23:12.542
That's not possible.

01:23:13.125 --> 01:23:14.667
Our worlds are different.

01:23:15.667 --> 01:23:18.583
I asked whether you want to,
not whether you can.

01:23:31.208 --> 01:23:32.625
I like watching you eat.

01:23:33.875 --> 01:23:35.417
You're cute when you eat.

01:23:40.000 --> 01:23:41.250
I've seen all of you.

01:23:42.083 --> 01:23:43.375
When you're stubborn,

01:23:43.667 --> 01:23:44.583
angry,

01:23:45.167 --> 01:23:46.000
sad,

01:23:46.917 --> 01:23:49.708
or even embarrassed...
you still look beautiful.

01:23:51.125 --> 01:23:52.792
You're like a brother to me.

01:23:54.333 --> 01:23:55.167
Ah.

01:24:11.708 --> 01:24:12.542
You awake?

01:24:13.333 --> 01:24:14.167
Yep.

01:24:16.083 --> 01:24:16.958
You cold?

01:24:17.792 --> 01:24:19.167
-No.
-Good night, then.

01:24:19.875 --> 01:24:20.708
OK.

01:24:26.208 --> 01:24:27.542
-Qiu.
-Yes?

01:24:28.667 --> 01:24:30.875
Thanks for always being there for me.

01:24:31.833 --> 01:24:34.833
No one treats me better than you
in the whole world.

01:25:51.167 --> 01:25:52.417
<i>Will we meet again?</i>

01:25:53.625 --> 01:25:54.875
<i>Recognize each other?</i>

01:25:57.292 --> 01:25:58.833
<i>We will reunite.</i>

01:25:59.958 --> 01:26:02.042
<i>No matter how our looks may change,</i>

01:26:02.333 --> 01:26:04.792
<i>we'll definitely recognize each other.</i>

01:27:00.500 --> 01:27:01.958
Kun!

01:28:09.417 --> 01:28:10.333
Time to leave.

01:28:11.667 --> 01:28:12.542
Go home now.

01:30:26.208 --> 01:30:27.667
-Qiu!
-Come here!

01:30:28.125 --> 01:30:29.125
Hold my hand!

01:30:31.125 --> 01:30:33.000
Quick! We're out of time!

01:30:37.042 --> 01:30:38.167
What's happening, Qiu?

01:30:38.750 --> 01:30:40.042
I'll get you out of here!

01:30:40.167 --> 01:30:41.750
So that you can be with Kun!

01:30:42.792 --> 01:30:44.417
Aren't we going home together?

01:30:44.500 --> 01:30:46.708
I got your life back from the Soul Keeper.

01:30:46.833 --> 01:30:48.500
I'll send you to the human world!

01:30:50.375 --> 01:30:52.292
No!

01:30:54.000 --> 01:30:55.000
-No!
-Chun!

01:30:55.917 --> 01:30:56.917
Listen to me!

01:30:57.167 --> 01:30:58.000
Chun!

01:30:59.125 --> 01:31:01.458
-Promise me. Hold on to my hand.
-Qiu!

01:31:01.583 --> 01:31:02.417
Don't let go!

01:31:03.458 --> 01:31:04.708
I must get you there.

01:31:05.250 --> 01:31:07.333
We'll meet again. Trust me!

01:31:11.083 --> 01:31:14.417
How I regret I didn't
hold you close in our last night together.

01:31:15.542 --> 01:31:17.042
You'll be happy with Kun.

01:31:17.667 --> 01:31:18.542
Come with me.

01:31:23.917 --> 01:31:25.417
On the count of three, jump!

01:31:27.000 --> 01:31:27.917
Trust me!

01:31:29.958 --> 01:31:30.792
One!

01:31:31.417 --> 01:31:32.250
Two!

01:31:33.000 --> 01:31:33.833
Three!

01:31:40.333 --> 01:31:43.542
I'll stay in the human world with you
as wind and rain.

01:31:47.708 --> 01:31:48.542
Qiu!

01:31:49.917 --> 01:31:50.750
Goodbye.

01:31:51.917 --> 01:31:52.750
Qiu.

01:33:15.167 --> 01:33:17.000
<i>Do you believe in miracles?</i>

01:33:18.792 --> 01:33:20.958
<i>Life is a journey.</i>

01:33:21.875 --> 01:33:24.167
<i>How many cycles of life have we waited</i>

01:33:24.250 --> 01:33:27.000
<i>for the opportunity to enjoy this journey?</i>

01:33:29.125 --> 01:33:32.375
<i>Life is short,</i>
<i>and we all have to go one day.</i>

01:33:33.542 --> 01:33:35.667
<i>We might as well be a little bolder.</i>

01:33:36.250 --> 01:33:37.417
<i>Fall in love.</i>

01:33:38.000 --> 01:33:39.292
<i>Climb up a mountain.</i>

01:33:39.875 --> 01:33:41.000
<i>Chase a dream.</i>

01:33:42.583 --> 01:33:45.292
<i>Yes,</i>
<i>it doesn't hurt to be a little bolder.</i>

01:33:47.958 --> 01:33:50.458
<i>There are many things I don't understand.</i>

01:33:51.458 --> 01:33:53.917
<i>There are many questions I can't answer.</i>

01:33:55.125 --> 01:33:56.000
<i>But I believe</i>

01:33:57.125 --> 01:33:58.792
<i>Heaven gave us life</i>

01:33:59.542 --> 01:34:02.542
<i>for us to create miracles.</i>

01:34:52.125 --> 01:34:54.917
Subtitle translation by:

01:38:21.000 --> 01:38:21.958
It's time.

01:38:39.500 --> 01:38:40.542
From now on,

01:38:41.083 --> 01:38:42.917
you'll take over my role.

01:38:44.875 --> 01:38:47.667
IN ANCIENT TIMES,
THERE WAS A GIANT TREE NAMED CHUN.

01:38:47.792 --> 01:38:50.833
ONE SPRINGTIME IN ITS WORLD
LASTED EIGHT HUNDRED YEARS,

01:38:50.958 --> 01:38:53.583
AND SO DID ONE AUTUMN.
